==French==

===Etymology===
{{etymon|fr|id=bear|inh|frm>ours>bear|tree=1|text=++}}

The Early Modern French pronunciation was {{IPAchar|/uʁ/}} before consonants, {{IPAchar|/uʁz/}} before vowels, and {{IPAchar|/uʁs/}} in [[pausa]]. For the most part, the pausal pronunciations were eventually lost, but in some cases they were re-established as the basic form (reinforced in part by the spelling, in part by related words; in this case perhaps the feminine {{m|fr|ourse}}).

